# .cursorindexingignore — exclude from codebase index/search only
# Files remain readable via @ mention or drag-and-drop.
# Docs: https://cursor.com/docs/reference/ignore-file
#
# Lockfiles are already skipped by Cursor’s default indexing list;
# listed here only for clarity. Large dumps/mocks belong here so you
# can still @ a sample without polluting search.

# --- Lockfiles (noisy; rarely needed, but keep @-able) ---
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
bun.lockb

# --- Large dumps / fixtures (index noise; open on demand) ---
data/
**/mocks/
**/__mocks__/
*.jsonl
*.parquet
